    "title": "SCSD#2 Announces New Principal of Sagebrush Elementary - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By cvannoy ,\n1 days ago At its board meeting on April 6, the Sheridan County School District No. 2 Board of Trustees approved Drew Gallagher as Sagebrush Elementary School principal. Gallagher will take the reins at Sagebrush in early August. Gallagher’s career in education includes three years as a teacher at Sagebrush Elementary School. For... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
